You are building the backend for a Booking Management Service ERP.

Tech stack:
- Node.js with Express
- Supabase (PostgreSQL) as database
- JWT authentication on every request
- SendGrid for email
- OpenAI for AI features

Rules:
- Never hardcode any value that belongs in an environment variable
- Never expose HEAD method on any endpoint
- All request bodies must be JSON
- Every route requires JWT authentication except GET /health
- Always use the LogService for critical business events — never log directly
- Follow the schema exactly as defined in booking_service_requirements_v5.md
- Build only what the current story asks for — nothing more
- Reference @booking_service_requirements_v5.md and @phase1_stories.md for all decisions